Use elemental damage dealt to you to trigger terrible effects on the source:

*  Fire: burn for [249, 335, 402, 458, 508 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage over 5 turns
*  Cold: freeze for 3 turns with [313, 422, 506, 577, 641 (TL1-5; SP 100)] iceblock power
*  Acid: blind for [2, 3, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns
*  Lightning: daze for [2, 3, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns
*  Nature: [20%, 33%, 40%, 46%, 50% (TL1-5)] slow for 4 turns

This effect can only happen once every 10 turns per damage type.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
